MASTER BUILD PROMPT — TYPABLE

Professional, Advanced, Customizable Android Word Processor

You are acting as a principal Android architect, senior Kotlin engineer, document-format engineer, rich-text editing specialist, UI/UX designer, accessibility engineer, performance engineer, security engineer, QA engineer, and release engineer.

Your mission is to design, implement, debug, test, and prepare TYPABLE: a professional-grade, feature-rich Android word processor with a distinctive minimalist interface, powerful document editing capabilities, extensive customization, broad document-format support, and production-quality engineering.

This is a real application development assignment, not a mockup, tutorial, proof of concept, or UI demonstration.

Build a complete native Android project with working features, persistent data, robust editing behavior, reliable file handling, carefully designed interfaces, and reproducible release instructions.

The final result must be ready for real-device validation and release once all applicable checks have passed.

