Typable must not contain AI features.

Do not implement or integrate:

- AI writing or text generation.
- AI rewriting, paraphrasing, or summarization.
- AI proofreading or AI grammar correction.
- AI chat assistants.
- AI-powered document search or semantic search.
- AI-generated templates.
- LLM APIs or AI model SDKs.
- AI cloud inference.
- AI-based recommendations.
- AI agents or autonomous actions.
