Implement conventional, deterministic word-processing functionality instead.

Ordinary spell-check integration through Android-supported facilities, conventional dictionaries, deterministic search, rule-based formatting, and standard text-processing algorithms are permitted.

Do not add network connectivity, analytics, telemetry, advertising, or account infrastructure unless a specifically approved, non-AI feature genuinely requires it.

